<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten values steady in light demand.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten values steady in light demand.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten prices were steady in light trade. Ideas feed prices will rise this summer increased buyer interest for June and July positions, but sellers were reluctant to sell, dealers said.</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -  unq	 unq</p>
<p>Gluten feed pellets		  Spot     -   97.00     97.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     May	-  350.00    unq</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLINTON AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA</p>
<p>Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -   86.00     86.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  350.00    350.00</p>
